WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.975
Section 2.

00:00:01.925 --> 00:00:05.000
The CF-18 Replacement Saga.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:16.900
Canada spent 30 years deciding to replace its jets, culminating in purchasing the exact same F-35s initially proposed, after wasting billions and decades on political theater.
